 & +\left.\left[1+n_{b}\left(\omega_{\boldsymbol{k}-\boldsymbol{k}'-\boldsymbol{q}}\right)+n_{b}\left(\epsilon_{2}-\epsilon_{1}-\omega_{\boldsymbol{k}-\boldsymbol{k}'-\boldsymbol{q}}\right)\right]\chi''\left(\bm{q},\epsilon_{2}-\epsilon_{1}-\omega_{\boldsymbol{k}-\boldsymbol{k}'-\boldsymbol{q}}\right)\right\} 
